        ],
        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Combining the selected row-initialization and Prim cycle-check changes with const-reference parameters and a packed SIMD minimum may reduce repeated graph/vector copies and Prim selection overhead without changing tie order or path behavior.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
