        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A three-way streaming partition, insertion sort for small contiguous ranges, and coarse OpenMP tasks for only large partitions may improve locality and use the four cores without making small cases pay task overhead. Median-of-three pivots avoid shared PRNG access in parallel sorting; generation remains unchanged.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
