        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A two-ended Hoare partition should reduce unnecessary array stores and make partition passes more cache-friendly than the current single-ended Lomuto scan. Recursing only into the smaller side also bounds stack use without changing case generation or its PRNG sequence.",
