        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A reusable 64 KiB contiguous staging buffer will reduce per-character stream work and improve output locality, while flushing in bounded chunks preserves memory limits and exact output. Disabling iostream/stdio synchronization avoids unnecessary coordination for this program's iostream-only I/O.",
