        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "For larger graphs, evaluating independent permutations in bounded OpenMP work-sharing batches can accelerate verification while a single thread preserves Heap enumeration and output order; small graphs remain serial to avoid thread startup costs.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
