        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A generation-stamped occupancy map should reduce per-candidate box checks while push-only sorted-vector reinsertion avoids full bubble sorts; explicit bounds checks also prevent out-of-range cell access. These changes preserve serial BFS ordering.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
