        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Combining the measured stamped occupancy map and push-only sorted-box reinsertion with contiguous BFS frontier arrays may reduce box checks and improve frontier traversal locality. Reversing each generated next-level array preserves the original prepended-list visitation order and therefore the required tie selection; the integrated effect needs measurement.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
