        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A contiguous max-heap of selected neighbors should reduce top-k memory traffic and work for larger k, while the sequential traversal of each group's points remains unchanged. Keeping traversal ordinals in heap entries preserves the source's preference for earlier points at equal distances.",
