        "integration_sources": [],
        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "For sufficiently large point-count × top-k work, an OpenMP static partition lets threads maintain independent stable top-k lists and reduces serial insertion work; merging those lists in thread order should preserve equal-distance selection and improve runtime on the four-core target.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
