        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A bounded max-heap reduces top-k maintenance from repeated O(k) scans and shifts to O(log k) per point while preserving earlier traversal order for equal distances. This should improve the full program when top-k maintenance is a significant cost; the controller should verify the result on the target.",
