        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A bounded max-heap reduces top-k maintenance work while traversal ordinals preserve earlier-point precedence for equal distances. Capping heap storage at the point count avoids excess heap allocation; rerunning the original scan on a NaN distance preserves its ordering behavior. The controller should evaluate the integrated program's correctness and speed.",
