        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Maintaining vertical column-band sums reduces repeated S-element window updates to O(N^2) work for larger windows, while SIMD over independent columns and the initial horizontal reduction can accelerate those loops. Keeping the original traversal for S <= 2 avoids extra band-maintenance work when windows are tiny.",
