        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Maintaining rolling vertical column sums reduces the search from O(SN^2) to O(N^2) without a full 64-bit summed-area table; static OpenMP work sharing and a max reduction parallelize window evaluation while keeping auxiliary memory O(N).",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
