        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Streaming the matrix through a contiguous S-row circular buffer while maintaining per-column totals avoids retaining the full matrix, reducing working-set size when S is small; scanning horizontal windows from the totals preserves O(N²) work with sequential accesses.",
