        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A padded 64-bit summed-area table makes each S×S window sum constant-time and independent, replacing the O(SN²) search with O(N²) construction and parallel window evaluation. Static scheduling and a max reduction should exploit the four CPU cores while tiled prefix construction limits strided-access costs.",
