        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Unpacking all six Body fields into contiguous arrays may reduce the repeated force loop's memory traffic and make the independent target-body iterations easier for GCC to SIMD-vectorize. The inner j traversal and each target's floating-point accumulation order remain unchanged.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
