        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Grouping four target bodies per statically scheduled work item and SIMD-processing those independent targets can reuse source coordinates and improve force-kernel throughput on the four-core ARM64 target. A single OpenMP team spans all iterations, while small inputs use a serialized team; each target still accumulates sources in ascending order.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
