          "retained": [
            "Use a persistent OpenMP parallel region for all simulation iterations, with static worksharing for target tiles and position updates and an implicit force-to-update barrier.",
            "Process four targets together, preload their coordinates, and apply OpenMP SIMD across target lanes while preserving each target's original ascending source-body accumulation order.",
            "Use a generic body-count threshold to avoid creating a multi-thread team for small inputs; the same loops remain a serial fallback when OpenMP pragmas are ignored."
