        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A persistent OpenMP team amortizes startup across all simulation iterations, while static worksharing distributes equal-cost target and integration loops; a generic body-count threshold keeps small inputs serial. This should improve full-program time on the four-core target without changing each target's ascending source-body accumulation order.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
