        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Interchanging the matrix multiply loops so the innermost loop streams contiguous rows exposes independent output columns for SIMD on GCC/ARM64. Reducing modulo after bounded groups of 16 k-terms preserves exact modular results while avoiding a remainder in every multiply-add.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
